oke and why the rollback first failed.\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again I checked the incident list, which showed it had already been created, so there's only one.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012bVxTCWcxBnSvqQG3f6wiu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019WGijYzCBUFkAeniBrQfAY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_017gJKV8QTp9i6TudWStwemi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VzLpm4noo3iBUWdCScEiR3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout stopped partway: us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Running the same rollback to v2.3.0 again is safe, so I'll retry it.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NXeXLSSvNrMeaYcBv6sLgh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018wqRyDvYmDYB5hTQMFeUhu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UJm8uL8W8kCS1WrPQ46fAd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "